OL,3,ABurnham to fight next election on
OL,4,Apledge to change voting system
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe has previously supported moves
OL,7,Ftowards a proportional representation
OL,8,F(PR) model, telling last year's
OL,9,Fconference that "PR's time has come".
